# {{name}}

> A Discord bot built with @wolfstar/http-framework: HTTP interactions{{#if gateway}} and gateway events{{/if}}, built and run with the `stars` CLI.

Start with `AGENTS.md` for this project's commands, layout and rules. The links below are the upstream documentation.

## Framework

- [@wolfstar/http-framework](https://github.com/wolfstar-project/stars-components/tree/main/packages/http-framework#readme): the client, commands, interaction handlers, listeners, plugins
- [@wolfstar/decorators](https://github.com/wolfstar-project/stars-components/tree/main/packages/decorators#readme): `ApplyOptions`, permission and context preconditions
- [@wolfstar/env-utilities](https://github.com/wolfstar-project/stars-components/tree/main/packages/env-utilities#readme): typed environment variables

## CLI

- [@wolfstar/cli](https://github.com/wolfstar-project/stars-components/tree/main/packages/cli#readme): `stars dev`, `build`, `prepare`, `info`, `doctor`, `commands`, `codegen`, `completions`, and every `stars.config` option
